# Keep the build context small, and — critically — never copy the host's node_modules or built
# artifacts into the image. The host's native modules (better-sqlite3) are built for the host OS and
# would break inside the Linux image; the image installs and builds its own.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
out
**/out
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.githooks
.DS_Store

# Local data and dev scratch that has no business in an image.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
blobs/
